WEBVTT

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.530
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.320
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.060
Today's story is about 
a girl who loves to cook!

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.000
I can't wait!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.280
But she seems troubled.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.290
Well then, let's come up with a 
tasty solution to her problems!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.360
Yeah!

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.380
Ready, set...

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.280
Doki!

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.100
Let's go!

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:49.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:56.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:08.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:13.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:19.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:23.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:31.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:39.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:01.790
It sure is nice to enjoy a Sunday eating 
snacks outside with everyone.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.730
Thanks for inviting us over, Tadase-kun.

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:05.270
Sure.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:09.880
I bet you secretly hoped it would be 
just you and a certain someone.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.160
Let's take the hint, Yaya.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.750
This is the perfect time for 
the rest of us to leave.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.580
C-Cut it out, Rima.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:18.720
N-No, it's not like that.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.820
This has a nice color palette.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.410
Aren't you gonna eat that?

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.900
Then allow me!

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.290
My cake!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.120
I wanted to observe it 
thoroughly before I ate it!

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.810
If you wanted to eat it, 
you should've done so.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:37.350
But you were spacing out...

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.490
I wasn't spacing!

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.500
Give me back my cake!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.350
Too late! I'm outta here!

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:47.840
Now you two, you must eat calmly or you'll get tummyaches.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.350
No fair! Don't eat it all yourself!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.210
Don't be cheeky!

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.800
I am not being cheeky!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.890
You act like such a goody-goody!

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.100
No, I don't!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.520
Yes, you do!

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:05.520
For crying out loud, 
you guys, give it a rest.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.390
But Miki and Su are...

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.750
This is all Ran's fault!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.600
Enough...

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.590
This cake is interesting-dechu.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.720
It's got little bits inside it.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.990
That's rice.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.080
The batter has rice in it.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.480
Oh, I see.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.760
It's on this cafe's new menu.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.200
What's she doing?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.930
Researching cakes or something, maybe?

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:47.140
Episode 73
Classified! Make-up Recipe?

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:54.060
While everyone studies, we will be holding 
an emergency Guardian Character meeting!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:57.350
Today's topic: coming up with a 
way to capture the Embryo.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.430
First, we'll aim for it after 
it's been lured out by a ? Egg.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.940
Right, and then in one fell swoop...

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.890
That'll never work-dechu.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.130
We're up against the 
Embryo, you know-dechu!

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.860
What would you suggest?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.370
It's simple-dechu.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:18.480
We have our fastest member, Ran, 
chase the Embryo and then...

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.970
We did it!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.010
I don't know if I could pull that off...

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:28.260
Someone who can eat another 
person's cake in a flash...

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.470
should be able to handle Embryo-chasing 
even before breakfast, no?

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:35.320
But I wonder if Embryo-san 
would be captured so easily.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.390
Maybe we should set a trap.

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.290
We should definitely leave the 
clever tricks up to Miki-tan-dechu.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:49.240
But wouldn't the Embryo escape while 
Miki's, um, "observing" or whatever?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.110
I'm not impatient, 
unlike <i>someone</i> I know!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:57.070
The fastest one? More like 
the one who never calms down.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:58.490
You're one to talk!

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:02.810
You'll never catch the Embryo by 
painting pictures or making music!

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.480
You're no help to Amu-chan <i>at all!</i>

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:12.330
That's not true! Amu-chan needs a Guardian 
Character with an artistic sense like mine!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.600
I'm number one!

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:14.310
No, me!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:17.250
Will you two never let this go?

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.580
What's that, Su?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.140
Little Miss Goody Two-Shoes!

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.440
You were the same yesterday!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:22.650
You are so darned cheeky!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.850
I am most definitely not cheeky!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.470
Cooking and cleaning are 
fundamental parts of daily life.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.220
Therefore, I am the most 
useful to Amu-chan.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.390
No, I am!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.890
No, me!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.660
W-W-What are we going to do?

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.310
The three of them were fighting?

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.640
Come on, guys, 
hurry up and apologize.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:01.310
Fine. If you want to act this way, so be it.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.980
I'm going to look for Su.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.580
We'll help you.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.560
Yeah!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:09.200
Kiseki, please look after things here.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:10.930
Sure.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.290
I don't care what Ran or Miki say!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.780
That girl was at the cake shop.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.350
Delicious!

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:35.990
A recipe using celery, huh? 
Use them pickled in soup...

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.230
Their leaves also taste 
yummy in miso soup.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.770
Who was that just now?

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.950
She can hear my voice?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:50.560
But it doesn't look like she can see me.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.250
Could it have been a cooking fairy?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.240
Morino Mimori-chan.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.480
You sure have a lot of recipes.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.970
Do you dream of becoming a chef?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.520
If you're really there, I wish you'd help me become a chef.

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:10.530
I mean, I wish you'd help me become a food critic.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.230
Oh, not a chef?

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.890
Cooking is so mysterious.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.490
After you collect various ingredients...

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:22.350
they're combined into a flavor 
they'd never have on their own.

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.470
That's so true!

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:29.570
I want to introduce mouthwatering 
dishes to all kinds of people!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:33.220
Who am I kidding... 
It's not like fairies exist.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:37.440
There are Guardian Characters, though.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.550
The output is at 82%.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.890
We should be able to 
raise it a little higher.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.170
Ikuto, are you okay?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.300
Ikuto!

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.140
Don't worry about me.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.530
I'll be fine if I just rest a little.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.520
Su?

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.660
Su-chan!

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.780
Maybe this is actually my fault...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.930
Dia once told me...

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:19.020
I can hear the voice of your heart.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:24.850
You are a lost child. Even if you
 save X Eggs, or your friends,

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.280
you still don't have confidence in yourself.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.100
You are hesitant, and you waver.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:35.270
I wonder if they're fighting 
because I'm wavering again.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:39.780
Now hold on. That's exactly why you 
were able to meet them all, Amu-chi!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:44.770
Those three are just trying 
their hardest to help you.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.990
Guardian Characters will always 
be their bearer's allies.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:49.810
And not just them.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.630
Kiseki's the same.

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.700
Kusukusu, too.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.360
Even Pepe-chan!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:04.110
I'm sure they'll make up soon.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:04.600
Yeah.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.650
That's right!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.890
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.740
Let's split up and search.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:11.910
Roger!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.040
Sorry about this.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.590
Ikuto, get better-nya!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.270
It's those creeps from Easter-nya!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.580
This is bad-nya.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.160
Look, look, I've got funny manga!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:48.500
And now Kiseki-tan will 
tell a silly story-dechu!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.520
Not on your life!

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.790
Strategy meeting!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.680
If you'd just told a funny story, like I said...

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.750
Ran, Miki.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.020
Dia!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:16.380
Please reconcile quickly. Everyone is worried.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:21.960
We're all one, after all.

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:37.060
Let's play a game-dechu. 
If those two work together...

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:49.850
I see!

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:54.090
Apple pie! I'll have to make one for every-

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:59.140
Amu-chan, Ran, Miki...

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.520
There you are, Mimori!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.350
Huh? What's the matter?

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.240
What do you mean?

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:10.910
Didn't you promise us you'd show us 
how to make a delicious stew today?

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.740
Dia!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.140
I'm sure she went this way!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:20.490
It was this way!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.000
No, this way, darnit!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.010
Dia...

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.520
Nagi's there, too.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.350
Did Ran and Miki make up?

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:35.930
I see. But they'll be okay.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.650
Those two actually get along very well.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.570
I envy Amu-chan.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.100
She's surrounded by such 
wonderful Guardian Characters.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:52.850
I wonder when my two eggs will hatch...

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.800
Dia...

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.890
Thank you, Dia.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:19.550
Don't worry, we'll handle that.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.870
Just teach us the recipe, Mimori.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.580
You're not very good at cooking, huh?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:30.470
But the recipes you teach us are so good. 
I'm sure you'll make a great food critic.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.510
Uh, sure...

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:37.220
Her honest desire really is to be a chef.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.220
There's no way I could ever be a 
chef when I suck at cooking.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.490
Don't say that!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:50.360
Even if I can't cook well myself, as long as 
I can introduce others to delicious food...

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.970
Oh, you just can't give up!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:56.510
Why is Hinamori Amu's 
Guardian Character here?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:57.540
Nana.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.890
Roger that!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.010
Nana-chan!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.570
What are you doing here?

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:10.530
My stars, I've suddenly got 
the shivers! And now a fever! {The my stars is just for her hamming it up, not an attempt to make her accenty :p}

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.510
Oh dear! You poor thing!

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:14.590
You must have a cold.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.290
You're lost, aren't you?

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:22.630
This jewelry will grant your wish.

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:27.250
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.250
Mimori-chan?

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:38.160
I'm cured! Thanks a bunch!

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.350
Huh?

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:43.180
I guess all that's left is for you 
to tell that funny story-dechu.

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:44.440
R-Really?

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.350
A ? Egg?

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.180
This is no time for fighting!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.200
Could we be sensing...

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.550
Nagi!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:03.370
I <i>can</i> cook.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:09.140
Everything I make is delicious! Delicious, I say!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:23.140
Character Transformation: Delicious Dream!

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:26.990
Have a taste of my cooking!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:32.560
Delicious!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.150
I'm starving!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.770
Delicious!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.600
My cooking is the best in the world!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.720
Stop this!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.600
Want to try some, too?

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:52.170
What should I do? Without Ran and the others, I can't Character Transform.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.760
Amu-chan!

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.220
Ran, Miki!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.060
Hinamori-san!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.430
You're all here!

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:00.920
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.390
No! Character Transform with me!

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.110
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.300
Character Transform with me!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.390
She said "Ran!"

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.620
This isn't the time for bickering!

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:10.610
Ran!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.200
Roger!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.810
My heart: Unlock!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:27.950
I can't Character Transform?

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.060
Why not?!

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:29.650
Miki!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.560
Okay!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.930
My heart: Unlock!

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.220
It's true! I really can't
 Character Transform!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:43.700
What's going on?

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:46.850
It's because their hearts aren't 
 aligned with one another.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:50.120
You'll never stop me from cooking!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.290
Amu-chan!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.160
Guys...

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.240
Mimori-chan!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.970
You mustn't do such things!

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.970
Su, don't! It's dangerous!

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:18.540
Mimori-chan, please stop this right now!

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.980
I've got my hands on a rare ingredient!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.070
Mimori-chan!

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.440
Now what? Su's been captured!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.410
Amu-chan, stay calm!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:41.150
Amu-chan and I will get her attention!

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.140
And while she's distracted...

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:44.560
I'll rescue Su, right?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:47.560
Right! It might be dangerous, though.

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.500
Concocting plans is your job, Miki.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.270
Just leave speed battles to me!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.180
Ran!

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.200
Okay, let's do it!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.850
Yeah!

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.500
Hey!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.800
Are you really such a great cook? {I know this is a bit non-literal, but ugh... we've talked about delicious cooking like four billion times}

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.140
I wonder about that.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.970
Amu-chan, Miki...

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:13.180
I'll prove it, and the first thing 
I'll cook up is <i>you!</i>

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:16.810
Amu!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:17.470
Amu-chan!

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.360
Go for it, Amu-chi!

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:20.220
You can do it!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:32.100
Mimori-chan, did you know 
butterburs are in season?

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:36.180
Oh, yeah! They go so well with
 fish in soy sauce, and also...

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.840
What are you doing? Stop it!

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:44.600
Shoot!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.730
She did it!

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:46.890
That's our Ran!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.220
I won't let you escape!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.390
Miki!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:54.150
Right!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.890
You can do it, guys!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:56.890
Hurry!

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:58.210
Go for it-dechu!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:17:59.990
Ran...

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:04.810
Ran, I'm very sorry.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.810
No, <i>I'm</i> sorry.

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:10.630
I'm sorry, too!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:12.490
Ran! Su!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.150
We're just like something you cook.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:19.470
Put us all together, and we 
create a scrumptious flavor!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.720
That's right! There is no number one!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.720
I need both of you, Ran and Su.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:30.090
And I need all of you!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:32.800
Amu-chan!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.040
Amu-chan!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:35.440
Amu-chan!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:43.180
My heart: Unlock!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:04.150
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.910
She Character Transformed!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:11.660
Let's go, you two!

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:12.680
Right!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.380
I won't let you escape!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.180
They're chasing us!

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:25.930
Okay! Amu-chan, Ran!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:26.810
Got it!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.480
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.850
Colorful Canvas!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.100
That's our Miki!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.560
Su's up next!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.560
Right!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:58.060
Mimori-chan, you'll become a great cook without having to do all this, I just know it!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:03.590
That's right! No one's good at 
something when they first start out!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:07.010
You've just gotta practice 
and you'll get better as you go!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.850
Will I really?

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.600
But I...

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:18.890
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.060
Open Heart!

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.410
What's this? You're quite determined all of a sudden.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:21:00.730
Well, being a food critic's a nice idea, 
but I think I'd honestly rather be a chef.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:01.810
What?

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:06.640
Yeah... I don't need to rush things.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.260
Thank you, Miss Fairy.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.930
Delicious!

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.430
"Delicious?" So you guys have reconciled, then?

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:21.420
Honestly! Commoners should not 
cause their King such concern!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.560
I actually agree with Kiseki-tan for once.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:30.810
What's so funny? You rascals!

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:45.100
Ah, that was yummy!

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.380
My stomach is so full!

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:47.930
Yep, definitely full!

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:51.330
My allowance for this month is shot...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.810
There you are!

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:54.520
Yoru!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.420
We're in trouble-nya! 
You've got to help us-nya!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.470
Calm down. What's happened?

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:03.020
Ikuto... Ikuto's in big trouble-nya!

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:26.450
We'll walk this path,

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:30.240
no matter what may happen.

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.530
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:38.450
something's bound to change!

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.760
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:58.130
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:01.510
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:06.260
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:09.720
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:17.180
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:22.480
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:26.350
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:32.440
We'll walk this path,

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:36.060
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:40.530
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:44.480
something definitely changes!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.130
Amu-chan, what are we 
going to do with Ikuto?

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:57.090
Well, I can't take him in. 
But I can't just leave him, either.

00:23:57.090 --> 00:24:02.630
What about flipping a 10 yen coin? Heads 
you keep him, and tails you leave him?

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:03.550
Su!

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:07.190
Putting that aside, it's almost 
a very important day!

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:07.810
Huh? What day?

00:24:08.020 --> 00:24:09.980
White Day!

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:12.250
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.250 --> 00:24:14.130
An Exciting White Day!

00:24:14.130 --> 00:24:16.110
Exciting? What's going to happen?

00:24:16.110 --> 00:24:16.910
Finally...

00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:17.670
The long-awaited...

00:24:17.670 --> 00:24:18.980
Desu!
